WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:05.480
The massive scope of the MCU has allowed Marvel
Studios to create a sprawling, interconnected

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:09.879
universe built on a shared continuity, and
much like the comics the movies are based

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:12.580
on, that means things can get pretty complicated.

00:00:13.089 --> 00:00:17.980
The Marvel Cinematic Universe doesn't start
with Tony Stark getting kidnapped in 2008,

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:22.640
Carol Danvers being taken to Hala in the '90s,
or even with Steve Rogers volunteering for

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:25.040
the Super Soldier program in the '40s.

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:29.140
Instead, like most universes, this one starts
at the Big Bang.

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:34.260
Going chronologically, the first event we
see in the MCU is the creation of the Infinity

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:34.900
Stones.

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:39.760
As the Collector explains in Guardians of
the Galaxy, they were formed from the "six

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:44.070
singularities" that caused the universe to
explode into existence, before being scattered

00:00:44.070 --> 00:00:45.440
across the universe.

00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:50.079
That, of course, was billions of years ago,
but "millions of years" before we get to the

00:00:50.079 --> 00:00:55.489
present-day MCU, Ego the Living Planet comes
into existence and starts seeding worlds with

00:00:55.489 --> 00:00:59.320
his essence in an attempt to create another
Celestial being like himself.

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:04.500
Thousands of years ago, as we find out in
Thor: The Dark World, Malekith the Accursed

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:08.300
laid siege to Asgard and was fought off by
Bor, the father of Odin.

00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:12.280
Bor "vanquished" Malekith, which turns out
to be a temporary solution.

00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:16.580
While we don't know exactly when it happens,
the next chronological event that we see from

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:21.821
our characters is Odin's conquest of the Nine
Realms alongside his first child, Hela, Goddess

00:01:21.821 --> 00:01:22.380
of Death.

00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:27.720
During this era, the magic warhammer Mjolnir
is forged in the heart of a dying star, and

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:30.300
long before Thor, Hela carries it into battle.

00:01:30.640 --> 00:01:35.220
Once the realms have been conquered, Hela's
bloodthirsty nature causes Odin to turn against

00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:38.440
her, and in the battle that follows, Hela
destroys the Valkyries.

00:01:38.670 --> 00:01:43.240
The sole surviving Valkyrie flees from Asgard
and eventually winds up drunk and depressed

00:01:43.240 --> 00:01:43.880
on Sakaar.

00:01:44.320 --> 00:01:48.920
Hela is then imprisoned in another dimension
by Odin, who literally covers up all traces

00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:50.140
of her existence.

00:01:50.560 --> 00:01:55.440
Sometime after that, but still pretty far
back, Odin and Frigga have a son, Thor.

00:01:55.720 --> 00:02:00.800
Shortly thereafter, Odin slays the frost giant
Laufey and adopts his son, Loki, as his own.

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:03.380
As children, they did not exactly get along.

00:02:03.670 --> 00:02:06.840
"He transformed himself into a snake, and
he knows I love snakes, so I picked up the

00:02:06.850 --> 00:02:10.360
snake to admire it, then he transformed back
into himself and said, ‘BYAH!

00:02:10.360 --> 00:02:11.680
It’s me!’ and then he stabbed me."

00:02:12.420 --> 00:02:16.900
Also "millions of years" before the present
day, a meteorite made of the super-metal Vibranium

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:20.560
strikes Earth in Africa, drastically affecting
the surrounding area.

00:02:20.960 --> 00:02:25.700
Much, much later, this area becomes the country
of Wakanda when a "warrior shaman" receives

00:02:25.700 --> 00:02:30.980
a vision from the goddess Bast and founds
a dynasty of kings known as the Black Panthers.

00:02:31.240 --> 00:02:35.760
Believe it or not, there's not a whole lot
that happens between the unification of Wakanda

00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:36.820
and the 20th century.

00:02:37.160 --> 00:02:41.580
The first big event that we see in the movies
is the arrival of, well, the First Avenger.

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:47.460
In 1942, a Nazi officer known as the Red Skull
creates a splinter group called Hydra.

00:02:47.760 --> 00:02:51.819
With the discovery of one of the Infinity
Stones, he creates a technologically advanced

00:02:51.820 --> 00:02:52.800
army of his own.

00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:58.220
That same year, Steve Rogers volunteers for
an experimental attempt at creating a "super

00:02:58.220 --> 00:03:01.660
soldier" using a technique created by Dr.
Abraham Erskine.

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:06.000
The project works, giving Steve the body of
Marvel's hunkiest Chris.

00:03:06.440 --> 00:03:09.220
When Erskine is assassinated, the research
is lost.

00:03:09.510 --> 00:03:13.520
Rather than risking their only super-soldier
by sending him to fight in the war, the army

00:03:13.531 --> 00:03:18.250
gives Steve the codename "Captain America"
and uses him primarily as a spokesman to sell

00:03:18.250 --> 00:03:19.140
war bonds.

00:03:19.530 --> 00:03:23.640
Eventually, Steve becomes an active soldier
in the war, leading a strike team called the

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:24.980
Howling Commandos.

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:29.080
On one of their missions, his best friend
Bucky falls from a train in the mountains.

00:03:29.160 --> 00:03:33.840
Steve believes him to be dead, but he's actually
taken into custody by the Soviet Army and

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:37.600
brainwashed into becoming a super-assassin,
codenamed Winter Soldier.

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:42.540
After attempting to use the Tesseract, the
Red Skull is sucked into a wormhole, and somehow

00:03:42.540 --> 00:03:47.050
winds up on the distant planet Vormir, serving
as a sort of spectral guardian for the Soul

00:03:47.050 --> 00:03:47.550
Stone.

00:03:48.180 --> 00:03:52.760
As for Steve, he crashes a bomber jet into
the arctic to keep Hydra from destroying New

00:03:52.760 --> 00:03:53.260
York.

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:59.580
He is also presumed dead, but survives, frozen
in suspended animation for the next 66 years.

00:04:00.160 --> 00:04:05.959
While things are pretty quiet for the MCU
between 1945 and 1995, there are a few notable

00:04:05.960 --> 00:04:06.640
exceptions.

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:12.520
Peggy Carter continues to work for the Strategic
Science Reserve, first in New York in 1946,

00:04:12.520 --> 00:04:16.180
and then in Los Angeles alongside Howard Stark
in 1947.

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:21.180
Around this same time, the Soviet Union produces
the first graduates of its brutal Red Room

00:04:21.180 --> 00:04:24.880
facility, where orphaned girls are trained
as spies and assassins.

00:04:25.420 --> 00:04:30.520
Sometime shortly after this, Steve Rogers
travels back in time from 2023 to reunite

00:04:30.520 --> 00:04:31.240
with Peggy.

00:04:31.710 --> 00:04:35.900
She continues to work in military intelligence
for the next few decades with Stark, whose

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:40.250
defense contracts turn Stark Industries into
the world's leading arms manufacturer.

00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:45.800
By 1970, both of them are working out of SSR
Headquarters at Camp Lehigh, along with a

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:48.720
few other notable figures, including Arnim
Zola.

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:55.060
His body dies in 1972, and his brain is transferred
into a computer databank that continues Hydra's

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:56.500
infiltration of the government.

00:04:56.870 --> 00:05:02.320
Also, Hank Pym is working here, assisted by
Bill Foster in his experiments with the size-changing

00:05:02.330 --> 00:05:06.500
"Pym Particles" that will allow him and his
wife Janet Van Dyne to become the original

00:05:06.500 --> 00:05:07.780
Ant-Man and Wasp.

00:05:08.560 --> 00:05:14.160
In 1974, Howard Stark launches the Stark Expo,
displaying the "City of the Future," powered

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:17.620
by a clean-energy "ARC reactor" that's about
the size of a house.

00:05:18.030 --> 00:05:22.360
For some reason, he also hides the structure
of a "new element" in the arrangement of the

00:05:22.360 --> 00:05:26.580
buildings, which is the kind of science it
pays to not think too hard about.

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:31.560
In 1980, Ego comes to Earth, winning the heart
of Meredith Quill, and nine months later,

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:32.840
her son Peter is born.

00:05:33.280 --> 00:05:38.640
In '87, Janet Van Dyne is lost in the Quantum
Realm after she and Hank Pym attempt to stop

00:05:38.640 --> 00:05:41.780
a rogue Soviet missile targeting the United
States.

00:05:42.030 --> 00:05:47.360
In 1988, Meredith Quill dies from brain cancer,
intentionally caused by Ego, leaving her son

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:50.760
a mixtape of classic rock favorites before
she dies.

00:05:50.860 --> 00:05:55.400
Peter is then abducted by a band of outer-space
outlaws called the Ravagers, who give him

00:05:55.400 --> 00:05:56.840
a pretty terrible childhood.

00:05:56.970 --> 00:06:01.240
"Yondu was the guy who abducted me, kicked
the crap out of me so I could learn to fight,

00:06:01.240 --> 00:06:03.460
and kept me in terror by threatening to eat
me.

00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:04.320
"Eat you?!"

00:06:04.640 --> 00:06:05.140
"Yeah."

00:06:05.220 --> 00:06:10.620
In 1989, Pym resigns from the SSR after finding
out that they intended to use his Pym Particles

00:06:10.620 --> 00:06:11.840
to create weapons.

00:06:12.160 --> 00:06:16.800
The organization has also now been renamed
to the Strategic Homeland Intervention, Enforcement

00:06:16.820 --> 00:06:18.040
and Logistics Division.

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:19.820
"That's quite a mouthful."

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:21.320
"I know ... we're working on it."

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:26.420
Also that year, Air Force Captain Carol Danvers,
who uses the callsign "Avenger," volunteers

00:06:26.420 --> 00:06:29.940
for a test flight of a lightspeed engine powered
by the Tesseract.

00:06:30.389 --> 00:06:35.260
When they're shot down by the Kree, a militaristic
alien race constantly at war with the shapeshifting

00:06:35.270 --> 00:06:39.740
Skrulls, Carol's body is overloaded with the
Tesseract's energy, giving her incredible

00:06:39.740 --> 00:06:41.800
powers and also wiping her memory.

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:46.110
A Kree soldier named Yon-Rogg abducts her
and takes her back to his homeworld, Hala,

00:06:46.110 --> 00:06:50.040
here she is made to believe that she's actually
a Kree named Vers.

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:55.060
While all of this is happening on Earth, things
continue to develop in space.

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:59.820
Thanos, an incredibly powerful alien from
the planet Titan who's obsessed with balance,

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:04.480
begins to seek out the Infinity Stones, laying
waste to half of the population of entire

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:04.980
planets.

00:07:05.260 --> 00:07:09.120
He also occasionally abducts young survivors,
training them as soldiers.

00:07:09.480 --> 00:07:13.950
Assuming that most of the more humanoid characters
are around the same age as the people portraying

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:19.330
them, then his two most notable "adoptions"
happen in the late '80s or early '90s: Gamora

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:19.830
and Nebula.

00:07:20.140 --> 00:07:24.700
Every time the two "sisters" spar, Gamora
wins, and Thanos systematically replaces pieces

00:07:24.700 --> 00:07:27.340
of Nebula's body with cybernetic parts.

00:07:27.740 --> 00:07:33.500
In 1991, the Soviet government sends the Winter
Soldier to assassinate Howard and Maria Stark,

00:07:33.500 --> 00:07:34.960
making it look like a car accident.

00:07:35.400 --> 00:07:40.000
Their brilliant slacker son, Tony, is left
in charge of Stark Industries, along with

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:41.560
Obadiah Stane as CEO.

00:07:41.860 --> 00:07:46.640
Unbeknownst to Tony, Stane makes a tidy profit
from secret arms deals with terrorist groups.

00:07:47.100 --> 00:07:53.020
In 1992, King T'Chaka of Wakanda goes to Oakland,
California, to investigate arms deals involving

00:07:53.020 --> 00:07:54.260
stolen Vibranium.

00:07:54.540 --> 00:07:58.000
The culprit is his brother, N'Jobu, who is
killed in the altercation.

00:07:58.440 --> 00:08:02.840
N'Jobu's son, Erik, is a witness to the whole
thing and grows up craving revenge.

00:08:03.320 --> 00:08:07.949
In 1995, Carol Danvers ... still without her
memories of Earth ... returns to her home

00:08:07.949 --> 00:08:10.100
planet after escaping from the Skrulls.

00:08:10.540 --> 00:08:12.180
She teams up with S.H.I.E.L.D.

00:08:12.180 --> 00:08:15.520
Agents Nick Fury and Phil Coulson to stop
the Skrulls from invading Earth.

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:20.860
It turns out that the Kree are the bad guys,
with Yon-Rogg and Ronan the Accuser en route

00:08:20.860 --> 00:08:25.120
in search of the Infinity Stones that will
end their war of conquest once and for all.

00:08:25.640 --> 00:08:30.240
Finally at full power, Carol fights them off,
and in the process, an alien cat scratches

00:08:30.250 --> 00:08:34.849
Nick Fury's left eye, blinding it and causing
him to sport a fashionable eyepatch for the

00:08:34.849 --> 00:08:36.020
rest of the franchise.

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:40.520
Before she journeys back into space, Carol
gives Fury a pager that can summon her in

00:08:40.520 --> 00:08:42.100
case of a dire emergency.

00:08:42.570 --> 00:08:47.360
Inspired by Carol and her original callsign,
Fury lays the groundwork for the Avengers

00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:51.640
Initiative, a program designed to create a
team of super-powered heroes to deal with

00:08:51.640 --> 00:08:54.220
large-scale threats like alien invasions.

00:08:54.520 --> 00:09:00.100
In 1999, Tony Stark meets bio-engineers Maya
Hansen and Aldrich Killian at a conference

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:01.220
in Bern, Switzerland.

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:06.260
He's very rude to Aldrich, who remembers that
as a sore point for about 14 years.

00:09:06.750 --> 00:09:11.380
Throughout all this, Hydra continues its secret
infiltration of S.H.I.E.L.D. and all levels

00:09:11.380 --> 00:09:12.860
of the United States government.

00:09:14.660 --> 00:09:15.660
"Hail Hydra."

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:22.640
In 2008, we finally catch up to the MCU as
it happens.

00:09:22.860 --> 00:09:26.940
Tony Stark is demonstrating his newest weapons
in the Middle East when he's kidnapped by

00:09:26.950 --> 00:09:32.060
a terrorist organization called the Ten Rings,
in what will eventually be revealed as a plot

00:09:32.060 --> 00:09:34.000
by Stane to get Tony out of the picture.

00:09:34.480 --> 00:09:38.700
While he's imprisoned, the terrorists force
him and another captive, Dr. Ho Yinsen, who

00:09:39.020 --> 00:09:43.280
was also at that fateful 1999 convention in
Bern, to make weapons for them.

00:09:43.660 --> 00:09:48.920
Instead, Tony is able to recreate a miniaturized
ARC reactor, using it to stabilize a piece

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:51.080
of shrapnel that's lodged near his heart.

00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:52.360
"It's impossible!"

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:56.120
"Tony Stark was able to build this in a cave!

00:09:57.240 --> 00:09:58.900
With a box of scraps!"

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:04.320
The reactor also powers the Iron Man, a suit
of weaponized armor built from scrap, which

00:10:04.360 --> 00:10:06.780
allows Tony to escape after Yinsen's death.

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:12.000
He returns to America, eats a cheeseburger,
refines his design, and wipes out the Ten

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:15.280
Rings in a brutally effective display of the
Iron Man's weapons.

00:10:15.600 --> 00:10:20.000
He also defeats Stane, who attempts to kill
Tony and create his own massive suit of powered

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:20.500
armor.

00:10:20.840 --> 00:10:23.020
Tony then publicly reveals his identity...

00:10:23.980 --> 00:10:24.860
"I am Iron Man."

00:10:28.900 --> 00:10:32.320
... which causes Nick Fury to approach him
about the Avengers initiative.

00:10:32.840 --> 00:10:37.180
Around the same time as Tony's capture, Dr.
Bruce Banner is working on recreating the

00:10:37.180 --> 00:10:38.400
Super Soldier program.

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:43.980
Instead of Erskine's "Vita Rays," he uses
Gamma radiation, testing it on himself and

00:10:43.980 --> 00:10:49.600
turning himself into a rampaging, green, monstrous
Hulk whenever he gets angry… which is always.

00:10:49.780 --> 00:10:54.140
After the Hulk inadvertently injures Banner's
girlfriend, Betty Ross, he attempts to go

00:10:54.140 --> 00:10:58.080
underground, but returns to America in search
of a cure for his condition.

00:10:58.430 --> 00:11:03.100
He winds up dealing with a scientist named
Samuel Sterns, whose attempt to recreate the

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:07.920
Hulk turns special forces soldier Emil Blonsky
into the monstrous Abomination.

00:11:08.240 --> 00:11:13.660
Six months after revealing his identity publicly,
Tony Stark is called to testify before Congress,

00:11:13.660 --> 00:11:17.320
because they are justifiably concerned about
a private citizen building a suit of armor

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:18.760
that can vaporize a tank.

00:11:19.340 --> 00:11:23.660
To create their own version, they turn to
rival weapons manufacturer JustIn Hammer.

00:11:23.940 --> 00:11:28.680
After Tony's friend, Colonel James Rhodes,
delivers a prototype Iron Man suit, Hammer

00:11:28.680 --> 00:11:34.540
and Russian scientist Anton Vanko reverse-engineer
them into an army of militarized drones.

00:11:34.600 --> 00:11:38.580
Stark also gets a new personal assistant,
who is revealed to be S.H.I.E.L.D.

00:11:38.580 --> 00:11:41.640
agent and Red Room defector Natasha Romanoff,
the Black Widow.

00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:46.720
Rhodes gets his own suit of armor codenamed
War Machine, and he and Tony team up to defeat

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:47.720
Vanko and Hammer.

00:11:48.380 --> 00:11:52.520
Speaking of hammers, while all this is happening
on Earth, there's other stuff going on in

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:54.000
the Golden Realm of Asgard.

00:11:54.340 --> 00:11:58.760
Loki tricks Thor into antagonizing the Frost
Giants against Odin's orders.

00:11:59.020 --> 00:12:03.360
As a consequence, Odin exiles Thor to Earth
and enchants his hammer, Mjolnir.

00:12:03.720 --> 00:12:09.100
"Whosoever holds this hammer, if he be worthy,
should possess the power of Thor."

00:12:12.620 --> 00:12:16.720
It lands in New Mexico, where Agent Coulson
discovers it, and a bunch of locals try to

00:12:16.720 --> 00:12:18.740
yank it out of the ground with pickup trucks.

00:12:19.100 --> 00:12:23.500
Thor eventually proves himself worthy, regains
his hammer, and stops Loki from staging a

00:12:23.500 --> 00:12:24.460
coup in Asgard.

00:12:24.770 --> 00:12:28.200
In 2011, the crashed Hydra plane is discovered
in the arctic.

00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:28.700
S.H.I.E.L.D.

00:12:28.700 --> 00:12:33.320
thaws out Captain America, and after realizing
that he's in the 21st century, he teams up

00:12:33.320 --> 00:12:35.040
with Nick Fury's Avengers Initiative.

00:12:35.460 --> 00:12:37.200
It turns out he was just in time!

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:43.580
In 2012, Loki, last seen adrift in space after
his failed coup in Asgard, is enlisted by

00:12:43.580 --> 00:12:46.089
Thanos to recover the Tesseract from Earth.

00:12:46.089 --> 00:12:51.740
In exchange, Thanos gives him control of the
Chitauri, a massive army of hive-minded destroyers.

00:12:51.940 --> 00:12:55.600
Loki agrees, because he's apparently in One
Of His Moods that day.

00:12:55.980 --> 00:13:00.320
The result is the Battle of Manhattan, in
which the Avengers ... Captain America, Iron

00:13:00.320 --> 00:13:04.840
Man, Thor, Black Widow, Hulk, and Hawkeye
... are gathered for the first time as a team.

00:13:05.280 --> 00:13:10.120
The good guys win after Loki is smashed against
the ground a lot, but the battle is extremely

00:13:10.120 --> 00:13:10.620
destructive.

00:13:10.900 --> 00:13:15.080
The reconstruction is mostly handled by the
newly formed Department of Damage Control,

00:13:15.420 --> 00:13:20.180
who take over the lucrative contract and leave
construction foreman Adrian Toomes embittered

00:13:20.180 --> 00:13:22.220
and in possession of advanced technology.

00:13:22.600 --> 00:13:28.040
In 2013, Tony Stark is left with post-traumatic
stress as a result of the battle and his concept

00:13:28.040 --> 00:13:32.570
of the universe suddenly expanding to include
gods, aliens, and other unknowable cosmic

00:13:32.570 --> 00:13:33.120
forces.

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:38.300
Unfortunately, this coincides with the return
of Aldrich Killian, who has been experimenting

00:13:38.310 --> 00:13:42.960
with Maya Hansen's regenerative "Extremis"
treatment, which has a tendency to cause its

00:13:42.960 --> 00:13:44.220
subjects to explode.

00:13:44.780 --> 00:13:49.260
To cover his operations, Killian creates a
fictional terrorist called the Mandarin, hiring

00:13:49.260 --> 00:13:52.460
an actor named Trevor Slattery to play him
in threatening videos.

00:13:52.940 --> 00:13:57.160
Needless to say, Tony and Rhodey stop Killian's
plot after they uncover the truth.

00:13:57.360 --> 00:13:58.740
"If you want something, take it.

00:13:58.840 --> 00:14:01.240
Although the guns are all fake, because the
wankers wouldn’t trust me with the real

00:14:01.240 --> 00:14:01.740
ones."

00:14:01.740 --> 00:14:02.240
“What?!”

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:03.200
“Hey, they’re fancy!

00:14:03.340 --> 00:14:04.340
Great with all the birds.”

00:14:04.500 --> 00:14:08.860
Also, Malekith comes back and Thor fights
him, and Loki becomes the latest in a long

00:14:08.860 --> 00:14:11.340
line of presumed deaths that actually aren't.

00:14:11.620 --> 00:14:16.180
He stashes Odin in a retirement home in New
York and then takes his identity, ruling over

00:14:16.180 --> 00:14:19.960
Asgard and putting on critically acclaimed
plays for the next two years.

00:14:20.600 --> 00:14:26.200
In 2014, Hydra's decades-long plot to infiltrate
and take over America is finally discovered

00:14:26.200 --> 00:14:27.940
by Captain America and Black Widow.

00:14:28.720 --> 00:14:33.020
"Before we get started… does anyone want
to get out?"

00:14:34.260 --> 00:14:37.020
They also learn that the Winter Soldier is
Bucky Barnes.

00:14:37.380 --> 00:14:41.850
While Cap fights to restore his best friend's
memories, the Hydra plot is exposed, and in

00:14:41.850 --> 00:14:42.720
the aftermath, S.H.I.E.L.D.

00:14:42.720 --> 00:14:47.780
collapses, leaving the Avengers without the
oversight and support of the larger organization.

00:14:48.320 --> 00:14:52.700
Tony Stark and Bruce Banner then attempt to
create an artificial intelligence that would

00:14:52.700 --> 00:14:53.940
help protect the world.

00:14:54.160 --> 00:14:59.320
Unfortunately, they goof that plan up big
time, instead creating a genocidal robot named

00:14:59.320 --> 00:15:03.160
Ultron who winds up destroying an entire country,
Sokovia.

00:15:03.520 --> 00:15:07.740
Tony and Banner decide that if at first you
don't succeed, make another robot and hope

00:15:07.740 --> 00:15:08.700
it's not genocidal.

00:15:08.700 --> 00:15:12.783
They transform Tony's onboard AI, Jarvis, into a much more

00:15:12.783 --> 00:15:14.643
heroic AI called the Vision.

00:15:15.143 --> 00:15:20.223
In the fight that follows, the Hulk hijacks
a Quinjet and blasts off into space, landing

00:15:20.223 --> 00:15:20.983
on Sakaar.

00:15:21.223 --> 00:15:25.703
Also, Scarlet Witch and Quicksilver, two definitely-not-mutants,
join the team.

00:15:26.223 --> 00:15:30.573
Quicksilver immediately dies, partly from
bullets but mostly because Disney and Fox

00:15:30.573 --> 00:15:33.043
were having a fight over who had the character's
film rights.

00:15:33.413 --> 00:15:37.783
The destruction of Sokovia also kills the
family of Helmut Zemo, who then dedicates

00:15:37.803 --> 00:15:39.183
his life to revenge.

00:15:39.583 --> 00:15:44.063
While all that's going on, Peter Quill is
out in space on a job to steal a valuable

00:15:44.143 --> 00:15:47.403
orb, which ... unbeknownst to him ... contains
an Infinity Stone.

00:15:47.663 --> 00:15:51.063
That puts him in the sights of both Ronan
the Accuser, who's been looking for another

00:15:51.063 --> 00:15:54.263
Infinity Stone since 1995, and Thanos.

00:15:54.683 --> 00:15:59.563
Ronan sends Gamora after Quill, and winds
up running across Drax, a very literal warrior

00:15:59.573 --> 00:16:04.492
whose family was killed by Thanos; Rocket,
a space raccoon who was painfully experimented

00:16:04.492 --> 00:16:07.763
on and given cybernetic enhancements; and
Groot, a tree.

00:16:08.103 --> 00:16:09.223
"I am Groot."

00:16:09.683 --> 00:16:14.123
After being imprisoned together, the five
of them stage a jailbreak, defeat Ronan in

00:16:14.133 --> 00:16:17.803
a dance-off, recover the Power Stone with
the help of the power of friendship, and turn

00:16:17.803 --> 00:16:21.643
it over to the Nova Corps, a bunch of space
cops on the planet Xandar.

00:16:21.803 --> 00:16:25.603
Shortly thereafter, Thanos attacks Xandar
and recovers it for himself.

00:16:26.263 --> 00:16:31.063
In 2015, an electrical engineer named Scott
Lang gets out of prison and stumbles onto

00:16:31.063 --> 00:16:33.503
Hank Pym's old size-changing equipment.

00:16:33.763 --> 00:16:37.903
Under the guidance of Pym and his daughter
Hope, Lang becomes the second Ant-Man, and

00:16:37.913 --> 00:16:42.163
helps to keep the Pym Particles from falling
in the hands of an evil arms dealer.

00:16:42.163 --> 00:16:46.273
More importantly, it's likely somewhere around
this time that a kid named Peter Parker is

00:16:46.273 --> 00:16:51.323
bitten by a radioactive spider, and tries
to capitalize on his new super-powers by becoming

00:16:51.323 --> 00:16:56.303
famous as Spider-Man, and fails to stop a
robber that later kills his Uncle Ben.

00:16:56.503 --> 00:17:00.843
None of this is covered in the MCU, but you
might've seen five other movies about it.

00:17:01.023 --> 00:17:05.643
The following year sees Helmut Zemo's plan
to destroy the Avengers reach its fruition.

00:17:06.013 --> 00:17:09.923
As the world responds to the destruction of
Sokovia by trying to install new governmental

00:17:09.942 --> 00:17:14.832
oversight over the Avengers, Zemo furthers
the a wedge between Captain America and Iron

00:17:14.832 --> 00:17:18.183
Man by revealing that Bucky was the one who
killed Tony Stark's parents.

00:17:18.723 --> 00:17:24.103
He also uses his control over Bucky to assassinate
King T'Chaka of Wakanda, leading the king's

00:17:24.112 --> 00:17:28.123
son T'Challa to take over leadership of the
country ... not to mention the identity and

00:17:28.123 --> 00:17:29.483
powers of the Black Panther.

00:17:30.083 --> 00:17:34.522
The end result of all of this is that the
Avengers break up, the ones loyal to Cap go

00:17:34.523 --> 00:17:38.623
underground, and T'Challa refuses to give
Zemo the death he desires.

00:17:39.203 --> 00:17:43.743
While all this is going on, Dr. Stephen Strange,
who lost the fine motor control in his hands

00:17:43.743 --> 00:17:48.662
after a car accident, seeks out the Ancient
One and, following her death, becomes a Master

00:17:48.663 --> 00:17:49.783
of the Mystic Arts.

00:17:50.332 --> 00:17:55.003
He stops an invasion by Dormammu, a demonic
force from the Dark Dimension, by using the

00:17:55.012 --> 00:17:59.623
Time Stone to die over and over again until
the cosmic villain gets annoyed enough to

00:17:59.623 --> 00:18:00.943
leave the Earth alone.

00:18:01.283 --> 00:18:06.183
Meanwhile, the Guardians of the Galaxy encounter
and subsequently kill Ego before he can manipulate

00:18:06.183 --> 00:18:09.603
Peter Quill into aiding his conquest of the
entire galaxy.

00:18:11.123 --> 00:18:12.043
“I’m Mary Poppins, y’all!”

00:18:15.243 --> 00:18:19.143
In the absence of the Avengers, Tony Stark
begins to mentor Peter Parker.

00:18:19.483 --> 00:18:23.843
As Spider-Man, Peter tries to deal with the
... wait for it ... evil arms dealer known

00:18:23.843 --> 00:18:28.723
as the Vulture, who turns out to be none other
than Adrian Toomes, his homecoming date's

00:18:28.723 --> 00:18:29.223
dad.

00:18:29.443 --> 00:18:33.723
The Vulture is defeated, arrested, and sent
to prison, but not before he and several of

00:18:33.723 --> 00:18:37.043
Peter's classmates figure out Spider-Man's
real identity.

00:18:37.343 --> 00:18:40.243
Also, Tony Stark finally proposes to Pepper
Potts.

00:18:40.803 --> 00:18:45.143
In Asgard, Thor returns from two years of
looking for Infinity Stones in various realms

00:18:45.143 --> 00:18:46.843
to discover Loki's deception.

00:18:47.332 --> 00:18:50.983
When they find the real Odin, he's at the
end of his life, and his death allows Hela

00:18:50.983 --> 00:18:53.183
to escape her millennia of imprisonment.

00:18:53.723 --> 00:18:57.843
She destroys Mjolnir, blasts the two brothers
into space, and takes over Asgard.

00:18:58.323 --> 00:19:02.582
Thor winds up on Sakaar, where he recruits
Hulk and Valkyrie for a mission to overthrow

00:19:02.582 --> 00:19:06.942
Hela, which goes about as well as it can for
a plan that ends with the complete destruction

00:19:06.943 --> 00:19:08.903
of Asgard via fire giant.

00:19:09.023 --> 00:19:12.683
“Hulk stop!  Just for once in your life, DON’T SMASH!”

00:19:13.863 --> 00:19:15.023
“BIG MONSTER!”

00:19:17.623 --> 00:19:22.343
In Wakanda, T'Challa's rule is challenged
by his cousin Erik, who teams up with another

00:19:22.343 --> 00:19:24.563
evil arms dealer Ulysses Klaue, another evil
arms dealer.

00:19:25.043 --> 00:19:27.803
There are a lot of evil arms dealers in these
movies.

00:19:28.183 --> 00:19:31.743
Erik betrays Klaue in order to gain favor
with Wakandans.

00:19:31.903 --> 00:19:36.143
He seemingly kills T'Challa and takes over,
but T'Challa returns and regains control of

00:19:36.143 --> 00:19:36.923
his country.

00:19:37.303 --> 00:19:38.763
"I never yielded!

00:19:39.943 --> 00:19:43.083
And as you can see, I am not dead!"

00:19:43.863 --> 00:19:48.023
After six years of waiting around, Thanos
decides to personally seek out the Infinity

00:19:48.043 --> 00:19:50.143
Stones, and the results are devastating.

00:19:50.643 --> 00:19:54.483
He kills Loki and nearly obliterates the last
surviving Asgardians.

00:19:54.703 --> 00:19:59.183
An attack on Earth leads to things getting
so desperate that the whole Avengers crew,

00:19:59.192 --> 00:20:03.363
except Hawkeye and Ant-Man, who are under
house arrest for violating the Sokovia Accords,

00:20:03.363 --> 00:20:05.303
need to get back together to sort it out.

00:20:05.843 --> 00:20:06.863
They don't do so well.

00:20:09.543 --> 00:20:11.063
"Dude, you're embarrassing me in front of
the wizards."

00:20:11.263 --> 00:20:12.323
“I don’t…”

00:20:12.743 --> 00:20:14.443
"It's okay stand down."

00:20:14.843 --> 00:20:15.523
"Keep an eye on him?"

00:20:16.163 --> 00:20:20.583
Despite fighting on two fronts, with one small
team in space and a massive force on Earth,

00:20:20.593 --> 00:20:25.662
Thanos gathers the stones, snaps his fingers,
and kills half the life forms in the universe,

00:20:25.663 --> 00:20:26.923
dissolving them into dust.

00:20:27.303 --> 00:20:32.183
As he dissolves, Nick Fury uses the space-pager
to alert Captain Marvel that Earth needs her

00:20:32.183 --> 00:20:32.683
help.

00:20:32.963 --> 00:20:37.903
A month later, Captain Marvel and the surviving
Avengers track Thanos down in space, only

00:20:37.903 --> 00:20:40.083
to find out that he's destroyed the stones.

00:20:40.423 --> 00:20:44.783
Thor beheads Thanos, and the Avengers return
home, having won this battle while losing

00:20:44.803 --> 00:20:45.763
the bigger war.

00:20:46.072 --> 00:20:50.643
Weirdly enough, all of this happens while
Ant-Man is involved in a relatively low-stakes

00:20:50.643 --> 00:20:51.383
heist movie.

00:20:51.923 --> 00:20:55.672
When the snap happens, he's left stranded
in the Quantum Realm, which turns out to be

00:20:55.672 --> 00:20:57.583
an extremely lucky coincidence.

00:20:57.932 --> 00:21:01.863
While he's there, five years go by, during
which the heroes deal with the horrific trauma

00:21:01.863 --> 00:21:05.743
of losing trillions of lives in various, mostly
unhealthy ways.

00:21:06.212 --> 00:21:10.363
Thanks to an assist from the most heroic rat
in the universe, Ant-Man returns from the

00:21:10.363 --> 00:21:13.543
Quantum Realm, where, for him, only a few
hours have passed.

00:21:13.963 --> 00:21:17.973
When he reunites with the Avengers, the heroes
realize that the solution to their problem

00:21:17.973 --> 00:21:18.473
is:

00:21:18.523 --> 00:21:19.363
"Time travel!"

00:21:19.503 --> 00:21:23.883
With the help of Iron Man and the now-smart
Hulk, the heroes travel back to various key

00:21:23.892 --> 00:21:28.782
points in the timeline to gather up the Infinity
Stones of those eras, along with Mjolnir,

00:21:28.783 --> 00:21:29.882
circa 2013.

00:21:30.383 --> 00:21:36.383
They also inadvertently bring the Thanos of
2014 forward to 2023, along with all of his

00:21:36.383 --> 00:21:36.883
minions.

00:21:37.303 --> 00:21:41.623
Right before he starts attacking, the Hulk
uses a rebuilt Infinity Gauntlet to wish everyone

00:21:41.623 --> 00:21:47.063
back to life, and virtually every hero in
the entire MCU takes Thanos on at once.

00:21:47.443 --> 00:21:52.363
The final blow is dealt by Iron Man, who dies
on the battlefield like a freaking rock star.

00:21:52.683 --> 00:21:57.263
After gathering for a funeral, Steve Rogers
hops into the timestream to return everything

00:21:57.263 --> 00:21:58.523
to where it should be.

00:21:58.583 --> 00:22:03.403
After living a full life with Peggy Carter
in an alternate past, he returns to this world

00:22:03.412 --> 00:22:08.373
one more time as an old man to bequeath his
shield to Sam Wilson, the Falcon, naming him

00:22:08.373 --> 00:22:09.823
the new Captain America.

00:22:10.363 --> 00:22:12.303
Check out one of our newest videos right here!

00:22:12.383 --> 00:22:15.543
Plus, even more Looper videos about the MCU
are coming soon.

00:22:15.943 --> 00:22:19.263
Subscribe to our YouTube channel and hit the
bell so you don't miss a single one.

